y be the only thing that can save it.", "summary": "Matcho is a narrative first-person action adventure. Tag targets, build chains, and execute combos with an innovative real-time Match-3 combat. Join Max as he fights through an alien invasion, uncovers the truth behind his illness, and races to find a cure before Earth falls under alien control.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/matcho", "videos": [{"id": 80857, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "QCWPHUxalX8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QCWPHUxalX8", "title": "MATCHO - Announcement Story Trailer (Revamped)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/QCWPHUxalX8/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 80858, "name": "Gameplay Trailer", "video_id": "2Jcc9-sBq48", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2Jcc9-sBq48", "title": "MATCHO - Gameplay Overview", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2Jcc9-sBq48/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 177018, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "K8OWgSnlvSU", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K8OWgSnlvSU", "title": "MATCHO: PLAY DEMO NOW", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/K8OWgSnlvSU/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}